<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/doesNotAffect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Vulnerability has no impact on each `to` Element. The use of the `doesNotAffect` is constrained to `VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship` classed relationships."@en .
